The <ansi fg="command">Mutation Catalyst</ansi> spell accelerates the target's mutagenic processes,
pushing Chrysalis transformation into overdrive. For those already
touched by the Chrysalis, this spell can awaken dormant traits and
speed the evolution of their mutations.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast mutation-catalyst [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Vital
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 12
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 270
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Mutation catalyst buff — accelerates mutagenic change

